{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "0f2c4af3-f8cc-8948-929b-f15ed417201e",
  "created_at": "2026-01-27T19:23:52-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Antonio Cabral",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:16:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:16:16-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Lorraine. Sorry, give me one second, I just came in from a walk and I'm still catching my breath. Those hills'll do it to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:16:30-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take your time. I'm right here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:16:34-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So I grew up down by the harbor, right? And when I was a kid, the plow guys came through before the milk truck did. Everybody's stoop was cleared by six. I'm not saying it should be like that now, but, you know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:16:58-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I hear you. What's going on out your way?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:17:04-05:00",
      "duration": 26,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's the street. Gidley Street, I'm at 411. Fifth Ward. That storm, the one Sunday into Monday, snow and then the rain, it left this wall of heavy slush and ice at the end of the street where the plow went by. And it froze up solid tonight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:17:30-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 411 Gidley Street. And that's the plow berm, the ridge left at the curb or at the end of the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:17:42-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Both, kind of. There's a ridge along the curb, but the worst of it is across the end of the walkway and the spot where you'd step off into the road. It's like concrete. I just walked past it and had to go around two parked cars."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:18:07-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And I'm guessing this is more than just your own walkway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:18:15-05:00",
      "duration": 28,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. I mean, I'm fine, I can climb over it. But the lady next door, she's in her eighties, she can't get out. She's got a cane, and her daughter drives over to take her to appointments, and the daughter can't get close either. She needs a path. Even just one shovel wide."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:18:43-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So there's an elderly neighbor who can't get out because of the ice and snow at the curb. Is she next door to you, same side of the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:18:59-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Same side, the next house up toward the corner. I don't know her number offhand. I'm 411, she's, I think 415. Yeah, 415."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:19:12-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, 415. And do you know if she's got anything scheduled this week, anything she has to get out for?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:19:23-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "She said something about a doctor Thursday. I didn't ask more than that. It's not my business."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:19:33-05:00",
      "duration": 29,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, I'll note Thursday. Let me read back what I have. Caller at 411 Gidley Street, Fifth Ward, reports a frozen plow ridge blocking the end of the walkway and curb access after the Sunday-into-Monday storm. Elderly neighbor at about 415 can't get out and needs a path cleared. Does that sound right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:20:02-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. And look, I want it logged. I called last night's number and it just rang, and I figured, it's after hours, nobody's at City Hall. This is the storm line, right? So I'm hoping somebody actually writes it down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:20:24-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, this is the storm line, and I'm logging it right now while we talk. It goes on the list for the crews and the supervisor sees it in the morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:20:41-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Because I'm a little annoyed, honestly. The main roads are clear, I saw that on my walk. Bellevue was bare. But the side streets, nothing. We got the plow once, and then it rained and froze, and nobody came back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:21:03-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. After a storm like that, with the rain turning to ice, the crews go main roads first and then work into the side streets. I can't tell you the hour, but I can get it on the list tonight with the note about the neighbor."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:21:28-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Can you put that she's elderly and has the cane? Make it so they see it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:21:37-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely. I'll put it as a mobility concern, elderly resident, needs a walking path at the curb. That usually gets looked at sooner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:21:50-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Because I don't want her trying to go out there herself. She would, too. She's stubborn."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:22:00-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Then it's good you called. Do you want a call back when it's done, or just a note on the log?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:22:12-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Call me back, if it's no trouble. Just so I know whether to go out with my own shovel and some salt."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:22:24-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. What's the best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:22:28-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0194."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:22:29-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 401-555-0194. And the name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:22:33-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Antonio Cabral. C-A-B-R-A-L."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:22:36-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Antonio Cabral, C-A-B-R-A-L. Got it. I've got you down for a callback at that number, 411 Gidley Street, and the neighbor's path noted."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:22:49-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. And I rent, if that matters, so it's not like I can call the landlord about the street. It's the city's plowing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:23:02-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood, the street side is ours. The walkway in front of the house is a different matter, but the ridge at the curb and the end of the street is what I've logged."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:23:20-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. I'll do my part on the walkway. Just the ridge, that's all I need."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:23:29-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Anything else I can add to the ticket before I send it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:23:37-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thanks, Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:23:41-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Cabral. Stay warm and watch your footing out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:23:48-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Goodnight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-27T19:23:51-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Goodnight."
    }
  ],
